  "localProxyAuthTitle": "Password for the local proxy",
  "localProxyAuthInfo": "The core's local port (127.0.0.1) is a full proxy into your VPN. Without a password any program on this device can connect to it and get your whole tunnel: the exit IP, your subscription quota and a way around your own split tunneling rules — including apps you marked “Block”. On Android this matters even more: there any installed app can see local ports.\n\nTurn it off only if you deliberately use this proxy from something that cannot authenticate.",
