  "localProxyDialogBody": "Needed only if you point a third-party program at our proxy (127.0.0.1) yourself. Leave the fields empty and the password will be random for every connection: it is not kept in the settings and never reaches the log or the support report. A password you set by hand stays in the settings file in plain text.",
